{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113219","id":3049397331,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc61whxT","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113219","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113219.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113219.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113219","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113219/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113219/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113219/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5f6903cdc653cccfe8ae84c3a0488a2a9ee77e8a","number":113219,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix overlap between texts in Make Unique (Recursive) Popup","user":{"login":"SanNull","id":124409014,"node_id":"U_kgDOB2pUtg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124409014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull","html_url":"https://github.com/SanNull","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"When a TreeIcon is set to have a checkbox, its text might overlap a bit with property name's (or the \"...\" can get pretty close of it):\r\n\r\n![default behavior](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/95fb9d37-c1b1-4d41-bd92-e427a1ecf767)\r\n\r\nThis may just be a slight issue, but for https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112711, which have title columns, it actually overlaps a ton:\n\r\n![okso](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/284894d6-7873-4c3c-8330-99c6ce6b8e06)\r\n\r\nSince this should be fixed regardless of whether the column titles stays or not, I decided to make a separate, focused PR on the matter. Now it doesn't touch property's text anymore:\r\n\r\n![sdsad](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/489ad331-fe5f-47ca-85ee-877c2a715a4d)\r\n\r\n>[!Note]\r\n>Since the bit of code I've added can also trim any text from a TreeItem with a checkbox, other unrelated areas to the popup might be affected. I've taken a look at areas I know have those (such as project settings) and the text stayed the same, so hopefully this doesn't cause a regression","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?